## Clues
1-2. A garden implement. ~ HOE
3-4. To divide into two parts. ~ HALVE
5-6. Generally eaten with beef. ~ MUSTARD
7-8. A gentle blow. ~ DAB
9-10. A color. ~ RED
11-12. The mythological god of shepherds. ~ PAN
13-14. To attempt. ~ TRY
15-16. Particulars. ~ DATA
17-18. Found in every house. ~ ROOM
19-20. A limb. ~ LEG
21-22. To possess. ~ OWN
23-24. A complete assortment. ~ SET
25-26. Place to put coal. ~ BIN
